{
 "ez_index": 320,
 "name": "ST63EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Universal Century 0083",
  "3 years since the One Year War.",
  "Those were also the years",
  "that had passed since",
  "space had at last",
  "regained its calm.",
  "Yet wounds that would not heal",
  "lay deep across the Earth Sphere.",
  "The One Year War.",
  "Its early One Week Battle",
  "above all claimed, by one count,",
  "2.8 billion lives.",
  "It began with the lightning",
  "seizure of Granada,",
  "and in an instant it destroyed",
  "the Federation garrisons",
  "in the colonies of Sides 1, 2 and 4.",
  "It was also, in all human history,",
  "the most horrific battle of all.",
  "No--it could hardly",
  "be called a battle. It was",
  "a massacre of sorts.",
  "Though fellow people of space,",
  "the Zeon forces used",
  "nukes and poison gas, weapons",
  "of slaughter, on the colonies,",
  "the cradles of space dwellers.",
  "Naturally, the colonies they struck",
  "were left without a single survivor.",
  "The targets may all have been",
  "colonies whose sympathies",
  "lay with the Earth Federation,",
  "but even the people of Zeon",
  "themselves found this operation",
  "hard to accept.",
  "Indeed, the Zeon leadership",
  "kept the horrors",
  "of the One Week Battle",
  "strictly secret until the war's end.",
  "Even senior field-grade officers,",
  "though aware",
  "the operation existed,",
  "in truth swallowed whole",
  "the leadership's claim that",
  "it was the rampage of a few units",
  "acting on their own authority.",
  "And the Cima Fleet,",
  "it is said, was one of",
  "those units that had run amok",
  "on their own initiative.",
  "The Delaz Fleet",
  "Delaz",
  "\"Commander Cima,",
  " this is a righteous uprising.\"",
  "Cima",
  "\"A righteous uprising?\"",
  "\"This operation",
  " will surely take the scattered",
  " hearts of the people of space...\"",
  "\"...and make them one once more.\"",
  "\"And the many obsessions",
  " of the past will fade away.\"",
  "\"Obsessions?\"",
  "\"Commander, you once",
  " served the Space Mobile Forces.\"",
  "\"I do not know",
  " what once befell the Cima Fleet,",
  " mind you.\"",
  "\"Let us act together,",
  " and go to Axis together.\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"You cannot go on",
  " drifting like a mayfly",
  " forever.\"",
  "Even so, it is hard to believe",
  "that poison gas and nukes,",
  "weapons needing large facilities",
  "and ample expertise to deploy,",
  "were brought in on the judgment",
  "of a handful of",
  "frontline commanders.",
  "Surely it is more reasonable",
  "to see the guiding hand",
  "of the homeland's leadership.",
  "In any event,",
  "such large-scale destruction",
  "filled space with countless debris,",
  "and tens of millions of refugees",
  "flooded the Earth Sphere.",
  "For decades to come,",
  "they would cast a great shadow",
  "over human history",
  "and become the trigger",
  "for still more wars.",
  "Space still",
  "bore deep scars.",
  "Enter South Burning",
  "Enter Cima Garahau",
  "With Kou Uraki in the lead,",
  "the Albion crew had grown",
  "by leaps and bounds.",
  "The Albion's MS squadron leader,",
  "South Burning,",
  "was perhaps the man who",
  "felt it most keenly.",
  "South Burning.",
  "Then 39 years old.",
  "A battle-hardened pilot who had",
  "fought through the One Year War.",
  "A soldier of renown since before",
  "the One Year War, he was among",
  "the oldest of mobile suit pilots.",
  "Indeed, in the One Year War,",
  "converting from conventional arms",
  "to mobile suits successfully",
  "was rare for a man his age.",
  "When it comes to mobile weapons,",
  "age matters a great deal.",
  "His age at the time, 36,",
  "was rather old",
  "even for a fighter pilot.",
  "And he switched to mobile suits,",
  "an entirely different branch.",
  "It can only be called reckless.",
  "Yet Burning endured",
  "the grueling conversion training,",
  "and with skill and rich experience",
  "led his men and fought well.",
  "He and his men earned the name",
  "'the Immortal 4th Platoon'",
  "since through the fierce battles",
  "of the One Year War, at Solomon",
  "and at A Baoa Qu,",
  "not one of them",
  "was ever killed.",
  "Caring above all for his men,",
  "he held that bringing them home",
  "alive was the finest result.",
  "That was the kind of commander",
  "South Burning was.",
  "Aboard the Albion",
  "Synapse",
  "\"Well,",
  " how are the youngsters doing...?\"",
  "Burning",
  "\"They're growing steadily, sir.\"",
  "\"Test pilots",
  " pick things up fast.",
  " Ensign Uraki most of all...\"",
  "\"With Nina-kun's",
  " support, no doubt?\"",
  "\"Even setting that aside,",
  " he's done more than well.\"",
  "\"Well, he owes her a lot,",
  " on duty and off.\"",
  "\"Youth is a fine thing.",
  " They strive single-mindedly",
  " for victory...\"",
  "\"By the way, Burning-kun,",
  " don't you have a wife on Earth?\"",
  "\"Well,",
  " something like that.\"",
  "\"How about it?",
  " Once this operation wraps up,",
  " why not put in for some leave?\"",
  "\"Captain,",
  " they may be growing,",
  " but even so!\"",
  "\"You're past the age",
  " of competing with youngsters.\"",
  "\"No, sir.",
  " It's all in how you feel.\"",
  "\"If you insist,",
  " I won't press it...\"",
  "\"...Truth is,",
  " my wife and I have been",
  " separated for some time...\"",
  "\"My apologies, then.\"",
  "\"No, it's quite all right.\"",
  "\"Even if the fight with Delaz",
  " turns out to be my last",
  " as a pilot...\"",
  "\"I just want to make sure",
  " I have no regrets.\"",
  "\"That goes for us both.\"",
  "For all he said,",
  "Burning still always kept",
  "his wife's photo in his locket.",
  "He loved her.",
  "In a sense, this was the clear",
  "difference between Burning",
  "and Zeon warriors like Gato.",
  "Burning had a life.",
  "A life of loving his wife",
  "and having a home.",
  "Soldier though he was,",
  "and however fleeting it might be,",
  "he lived a human life,",
  "and when the fighting ended,",
  "he was a man who went back to it.",
  "And he was a man",
  "who fought for that place",
  "he was meant to return to.",
  "Seen from where he stood,",
  "the stance of Gato and others",
  "who lived for a great cause",
  "could be summed up in one word:",
  "irresponsible.",
  "Of course, there is no record",
  "in history of him ever voicing",
  "such a view.",
  "But judging by his outlook",
  "and his conduct, this work",
  "believes he likely thought so.",
  "Yes: a place to return to.",
  "Seen through the eyes of those",
  "who fight for family and home,",
  "Gato's fight was irresponsible.",
  "A fight for the people of space,",
  "for self-rule and independence.",
  "It is a fine-sounding phrase.",
  "But",
  "what did Gato actually do",
  "in its name?",
  "And Delaz...",
  "no, the Principality of Zeon:",
  "what did they accomplish?",
  "What they carried out",
  "was massacre, war,",
  "and terrorism.",
  "In one sense,",
  "it could even be judged",
  "a failure of diplomacy.",
  "Of course, the guilt",
  "is not Zeon's alone.",
  "War could not be prevented",
  "because the Federation oppressed",
  "the people of space to begin with.",
  "But",
  "to answer that with massacre",
  "went too far.",
  "War,",
  "no matter how one struggles,",
  "is blind to the generation to come.",
  "A death leaves wounds",
  "on the heart that never fade.",
  "To heal that wound,",
  "people kill in the name of revenge.",
  "And those who suffer revenge",
  "kill again to avenge themselves.",
  "Such old-Earth thinking.",
  "In other words, inheriting",
  "the grudges of a bygone age only",
  "breeds a new chain of revenge.",
  "If you care for your children,",
  "why not live?",
  "Why not consider that your child,",
  "fatherless, will kill your enemy",
  "to avenge you?",
  "A child who loses a father",
  "kills the enemy to avenge him, and",
  "that enemy's child does the same.",
  "It is only natural.",
  "Love your children and family,",
  "and you must not die.",
  "To die is the same as telling",
  "your child to avenge you.",
  "Why can no one see that!",
  "No parent would gladly tell",
  "their own child to kill.",
  "Still less a grandchild.",
  "Knowing one's death would bring",
  "a chain of revenge down the ages,",
  "who would ever go to war?",
  "As Burning would put it,",
  "Gato, Delaz, the Federation",
  "and Zeon all lacked imagination.",
  "The One Year War hurt everyone.",
  "Not just Australia, hit by a colony,",
  "and the war-ravaged Earth, but",
  "the colonies of Sides 1, 2, 4, 5,",
  "the many asteroid bases,",
  "Federation cities and strongholds.",
  "Zeon was no different.",
  "Even now the Earth Sphere",
  "brims with refugees and poverty.",
  "What war's survivors must do",
  "is not to fight once more,",
  "but never to start a fight again.",
  "However...",
  "Neither the Federation leadership",
  "nor the Zeon remnants saw that.",
  "They saw this postwar time",
  "as if it were a period",
  "to prepare for the next war.",
  "The Federation was ruled by",
  "hawkish military bureaucrats",
  "split into factions; as for Zeon's",
  "remnants, save the Axis forces",
  "said to have left for an asteroid,",
  "they had sunk to petty terrorism",
  "in the Earth Sphere.",
  "And at every turn, both sides",
  "would bring out their mobile suits.",
  "Without ever stopping to think",
  "how many people would die!",
  "That is why Burning",
  "could not leave the military.",
  "The military is a place for killing.",
  "But at the same time,",
  "its work is protecting lives.",
  "Directly or indirectly,",
  "if by being involved he could",
  "accomplish even a little...",
  "With that in mind, he could not",
  "bring himself to leave the military.",
  "\"Uraki!",
  " Keith!",
  " What do you think you're doing?!\"",
  "\"Loafing about",
  " in a place like this!",
  " What about your alert duty?!\"",
  "Keith",
  "\"Well, this is, uh...\"",
  "\"No excuses!",
  " Slack like yours sinks ships!\"",
  "\"Uraki! You too?!\"",
  "Uraki",
  "\"Yes, sir!",
  " I'm sorry!\"",
  "\"Sorry won't cut it!\"",
  "Nina",
  "\"...!\"",
  "\"Tch,",
  " told you so.\"",
  "\"The lecture can wait, you lot!",
  " Follow me!\"",
  "Kou",
  "\"Yes, sir!\"",
  "Albion Bridge",
  "\"Status report!\"",
  "Operator",
  "\"A contact resembling a battleship",
  " turned up on our Minovsky",
  " interference trace. 5-1-9!\"",
  "\"Right by the Birmingham!",
  " How's the MS launch coming?!\"",
  "\"Launching at once!\"",
  "\"Too slow!\"",
  "For the place he must return to,",
  "the man takes the field once more.",
  "For what he must protect,",
  "for the place where he lives,",
  "he dares the jaws of death.",
  "\"I...",
  " I didn't know...\"",
  "\"I didn't know",
  " it was poison gas!!\"",
  "She",
  "always wakes with a start,",
  "drenched in sweat.",
  "It is always that same dream.",
  "\"...Tch! Again!",
  " This is why I",
  " hate sleeping!\"",
  "Has there ever been anyone",
  "whose reputation and reality",
  "were so far apart",
  "as Cima Garahau?",
  "Known commonly as",
  "commander of the Cima Fleet,",
  "she was spat upon",
  "by Zeon and Federation alike.",
  "That was because she",
  "and her marine assault force",
  "were the unit that carried out",
  "the infamous operation to pump",
  "GG gas into Side 2.",
  "War criminals who carried out",
  "so vile a mission coldly--no,",
  "with something like relish.",
  "That is how people have seen them.",
  "Yet historical records",
  "found later suggest this view",
  "was badly mistaken.",
  "They had not known",
  "it was GG gas.",
  "In fact, from the very start,",
  "the marine force's commander",
  "was not, in truth, Cima Garahau.",
  "She was never more",
  "than acting commander.",
  "The marine force's real commander",
  "was one Captain Asakura.",
  "A fleet commander, he was also",
  "technical advisor to the Solar Ray",
  "System, a mass-destruction weapon",
  "used at the One Year War's end.",
  "Or rather, it seems",
  "that from the start, overseeing",
  "dirty missions",
  "was his principal duty.",
  "With such a man in command,",
  "the nature of his fleet's missions",
  "is easy enough to guess.",
  "Yet for all that,",
  "he never directly dirtied",
  "his own hands.",
  "He named Cima",
  "acting fleet commander,",
  "stayed behind on Side 3,",
  "and dumped every mission he got",
  "onto Cima and her people.",
  "As a result,",
  "those who did all the dirty work",
  "were Cima and her fleet.",
  "The Cima Fleet, it is said,",
  "began as subcontract laborers",
  "for the Colony Corporation,",
  "forcibly rounded up from Side 3's",
  "3 Bunch, commonly called Mahal.",
  "Men barely on any register,",
  "a rabble hastily made soldiers.",
  "That was the Cima Fleet.",
  "In a sense, the only real soldier",
  "in the Cima Fleet was Cima Garahau",
  "herself.",
  "Even in her case,",
  "records are now hard to trace,",
  "and her prior service is unclear.",
  "All that is certain is that",
  "she too seems to have come",
  "from Mahal.",
  "After the incident on Side 2,",
  "as if to silence them,",
  "they were sent on brutal missions.",
  "And dirty work at that,",
  "far removed from glory.",
  "Most were missions that even",
  "those who carried them out",
  "would rather never recall.",
  "Even so, they answered",
  "the Principality's orders",
  "with truly loyal service.",
  "Were it not dirty work,",
  "the medals the Cima Fleet won",
  "alone could have built a house.",
  "But no one",
  "ever gave them a second thought.",
  "Not even after the war ended.",
  "After the war,",
  "Zeon's remaining forces",
  "gathered at Karama Point.",
  "But there, her superior",
  "handed her an order",
  "forbidding the Cima Fleet",
  "to withdraw",
  "to Axis.",
  "In effect,",
  "the Cima Fleet was cast aside.",
  "\"Why, sir?",
  " Have we no right",
  " to escape to Axis?\"",
  "Officer",
  "\"As I've told you time and again,",
  " your fleet strayed far",
  " beyond military law.\"",
  "\"Your crime of staining",
  " our glorious Zeon is grave.\"",
  "\"Strayed?",
  " Our special missions were all",
  " ordered by the homeland...\"",
  "\"I know nothing of that.",
  " Perhaps the late Lady Kycilia",
  " acted on her own, but still.\"",
  "\"Either way, you're a nuisance.",
  " Why not at least clean up",
  " your own mess yourselves?\"",
  "Many Zeon remnants,",
  "unaware of this,",
  "looked on them as",
  "shameful runaways.",
  "But that was wrong.",
  "In truth,",
  "it laid bare the outright class",
  "discrimination that existed",
  "even among the people of space,",
  "the result of the same cruelty",
  "and inhumanity",
  "the Earth Federation had shown",
  "the space emigrants.",
  "Wholly for their homeland,",
  "they wore down body and soul,",
  "gave up honor and heart itself.",
  "And the price?",
  "It was this treatment.",
  "Even so.",
  "But even so...",
  "If not for that one thing,",
  "Cima and the rest might never",
  "have become what they are now.",
  "If not for that cruel tragedy.",
  "Abandoned",
  "at Karama Point,",
  "they no longer had",
  "anywhere to go.",
  "For the Cima Fleet, who had",
  "pumped in poison gas and done",
  "so much dirty work,",
  "stood to be tried",
  "as war criminals.",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Damn it! Lady Cima,",
  " I'm done with this lousy fleet.",
  " I don't care if they arrest me.\"",
  "\"......\"",
  "\"Let's go home,",
  " back to Mahal, where we're from!\"",
  "And so they",
  "had made up their minds.",
  "Only, at the very end...",
  "once more,",
  "just once more would do,",
  "they wanted to see their home.",
  "Side 3, 3 Bunch. The colony Mahal.",
  "That was where they chose to die,",
  "and where they set their course.",
  "They never",
  "reached the colony Mahal.",
  "For by then",
  "Mahal had already vanished.",
  "The Solar Ray System, which",
  "Captain Asakura had advised on.",
  "It was a giant colony laser",
  "that used a colony as its barrel.",
  "Naturally, it needed",
  "a colony for its material.",
  "Yes,",
  "Mahal had been converted",
  "into the Solar Ray.",
  "Everything was shattered.",
  "Conscience, honor,",
  "a place to settle,",
  "even peace of mind, all taken...",
  "and as if that were not enough,",
  "they lost even their home.",
  "If this is not despair,",
  "what could be called so?",
  "To this day, Cima",
  "dreams of that tragedy on Side 2.",
  "Having lost everything,",
  "she was left with nightmares alone.",
  "\"We don't even have",
  " a home anymore.\"",
  "\"No--",
  " soon Earth will be",
  " our second home.\"",
  "\"We'll all go down there.",
  " That's right,",
  " we'll see what a 'mayfly' is.\"",
  "\"The Lili Marleen",
  " will take us there.\"",
  "Cima was faintly anxious.",
  "She would give her men peace.",
  "That was why she had signed on",
  "to 'Operation Stardust'",
  "and joined",
  "the Delaz Fleet.",
  "To give her men",
  "a new home,",
  "and never again",
  "to see that nightmare,",
  "she had to win",
  "the gamble",
  "that was about to unfold.",
  "\"Lieutenant,",
  " are you hurt?\"",
  "\"Yeah, I'm fine.",
  " Took a few rounds,",
  " but hey, the Albion's close.\"",
  "\"Splendid work,",
  " Lieutenant Burning.\"",
  "\"Thank you very much.\"",
  "\"Actually, there's one more",
  " prize, sir.",
  " I'll bring it as soon as I'm back.\"",
  "\"Oh?",
  " I'll look forward to it.\"",
  "\"Lieutenant...\"",
  "\"Hm?\"",
  "\"I guess",
  " I'd let my guard down.\"",
  "\"I heard what happened.",
  " That's done with.\"",
  "\"You're full-fledged pilots now.",
  " Just now you fought the enemy",
  " to a draw, or better.\"",
  "\"The rest is whether",
  " you can feel it for yourselves,",
  " and that I can't teach you.\"",
  "\"Yes...\"",
  "\"We've had this talk before.",
  " One night in Australia.\"",
  "\"Heh,",
  " all I remember",
  " is the push-ups.\"",
  "\"Ha ha, is that so.\"",
  "\"Oh, right, before we land.\"",
  "\"Per naval order:",
  " 'Operation Stardust,'",
  " Solomon Sea Execution Plan.\"",
  "\"This is amazing!",
  " The enemy's layout, plain as day!",
  " Huh! The Gundam GP02A!\"",
  "\"Lieutenant!",
  " What did you say?",
  " Gato?\"",
  "\"That's right!",
  " Uraki, Gato's on the move!\"",
  "\"!!",
  " What's their objective?\"",
  "\"Their objective...",
  " Wh-what is this!\"",
  "\"Huh?\"",
  "\"!\"",
  "\"Lieutenant!\"",
  "\"Lieutenant, answer me!",
  " ...Lieutenant!\"",
  "\"Lieutenant Burning!",
  " Lieutenant Burning--!\"",
  "Lieutenant Burning--",
  "posthumously promoted two ranks,",
  "Commander Burning--",
  "fell in the space near Solomon.",
  "His death forever took away",
  "the chance to expose",
  "Operation Stardust,",
  "and events began to race ahead."
 ]
}
